---
source: crates/standalone/fixture/src/lib.rs
---
Show the decisions behind the site, or behind one file.

Usage: ink explain [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments
  [PATH]  A file of the folder, as a path in it: only its decisions. Without
          one, every decision

Options
      --why <CODE>  Replay one decision's ladder, rung by rung: `ink explain
                    posts/a.md --why page.title`, or a site code alone (`--why
                    site.title`)

Source
      --source <KIND>  `folder` reads the files on disk, `git` reads a commit
                       [default: `git` when .git exists, said as a notice]
      --rev <REV>      The commit to read, as `git rev-parse` takes it; only for
                       a git repository [default: HEAD]

Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
More    ink explain --help adds examples, notes and exit codes
